{
  "_about": "OoT Randomizer settings for the remake, applied over OoTR's defaults. They describe the remake's world as the patcher leaves it: nothing about the world is opened or skipped (tools/rando/world_settings.py lists what can be), dungeon items stay in place, and every trick is off (config/tricks.json turns single tricks on for testing). Shuffles of location types the patcher can't change yet are off; those locations are also locked to their vanilla items by tools/rando/generate.py. Maps and compasses are removed (OoTR's 'remove'): their chests, the easiest to pair with certainty, hold other items instead. auto_equip_masks true: the remake keeps a worn mask on through area changes and reloads (OoTR's On, the remake's own behaviour); false plays as OoTR's Off (parity/_gaps_player.py).",
